        {
          "id": "59076d58-5f79-35d3-a21d-cf0dda72749a",
          "content": {
            "id": "59076d58-5f79-35d3-a21d-cf0dda72749a",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "European steelmakers warn of pressure on demand and pricing",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "(Reuters) -ArcelorMittal, Outokumpu and Aperam warned of mounting pressures from tariffs and weak demand, as the outlook for European steelmakers worsened following a mixed second quarter.  ArcelorMittal's quarterly core earnings were broadly in line with market expectations, while Outokumpu and Aperam beat analysts' estimates but projected lower earnings for the third quarter.",
